{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"61238b7fc024604d83dda97673302c7b82de53b49bd3033cc6979d2893f92934","ja":"謝る？　逃げる？","zh":"道歉？逃跑？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b9d247c68ec813dfb44af276bfc79a6617e319fd3c8b7b36e427e72b6203e439","ja":"ど、ど、ど……どうしよう！\n志保、めちゃくちゃ怒ってるぞ！？","zh":"怎、怎、怎……怎么办！\n志保她超级生气啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"51908475a319d702560867e9e25ffde3b4bece9a663bc9c86302fe7677e36eb8","ja":"うあうあ～！　こんなにメッセージ送ってくる\nなんて……律っちゃん並みの説教されちゃうかも！？","zh":"呜哇呜哇～！　发了这么多条消息过来，\n难道说……可能会被训得像律子那样惨吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"98f8a36ece5aa336e203af5d94866b720dfbf8001979e313938f00a5952e1349","ja":"そ、そんな！？\nと、とにかくはやく帰って謝ろうぜ！？　急げ！","zh":"怎、怎么会！？\n总、总之快点回去道歉吧！？赶快！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a1508822df1438c3b2b5f27fa08bc68b30dd86d2534be43eddace4221fac083f","ja":"お、遅れてごめん！！！","zh":"抱、抱歉我迟到了！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fd973a990004fbbc4eb6ea3173a7fc7f86c85c7eac1cb203414c50dde46cfa1b","ja":"すみませんでしたぁ～～～～～！！！","zh":"对不起啊～～～～～！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"95da9c315998a60feb1c7912017e3f5b4777c44e4704f78ac773592cec9ac521","ja":"はい、大丈夫ですよ。\nおふたりとも、事故などではなくて安心しました。","zh":"好的，没关系的。\n两位没有遇到事故什么的，真是让人松了一口气。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"152c7e600b6aed18e4a8fad1c45c14dd9a55bfb3ee48835f2373ffafc5602c0c","ja":"ホントごめんね！　ちなみに、なでしこだけ？\nしほりんはどこ？","zh":"真对不起！顺便问下，只有抚子吗？\n志保琳在哪里？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c736b8ef8fab4bbb1d20503fe1dfe21a8222f5892229f6f85eafd014b7fc2d14","ja":"志保さんなら、仕掛け人さまにお話があるそうで、\nさっきレッスンルームを出て行かれましたよ。","zh":"志保小姐的话，好像有话要和制作人先生说，\n刚才已经离开练习室了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ea128501840a8b7d27a4ec6029df6900456c1788c14b2b1117671471dbb54bed","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーと！？\nな、なに話してるんだろ！？","zh":"●●●●和制作人！？\n在、在聊些什么呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3f494d42129914b5feec5e225ce146995f76506eb00e55ebb0cd5a71c4feb2fb","ja":"も、もしかして、亜美たちの遅刻を報告して、\nなんかすんごい罰を決めようとしてる……とか！？","zh":"难道、难道说，是要汇报亚美她们迟到，\n然后决定什么超可怕的惩罚……之类的！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"1b89b26d29b765b5a98901d63ea547d67e8b0466592b43888a7fbd430fcd5337","ja":"えええ～～～っ！？\nそんな～！？　どうしよどうしよ！？","zh":"诶诶诶～～～！？\n怎么会这样～！？怎么办怎么办！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"cb5c241792ccaafb06af986bf93d1b0ec0153caf980a24e4de91e54629623ada","ja":"なでしこ！　亜美たち、\nお腹痛くて早退したって言っといて！","zh":"抚子！你就说亚美她们\n肚子痛早退了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4755d9fd638b714facaaa1768ae9541e5972424351e68bd45b21ad429ed0633d","ja":"も～、頭がどっかーんって、\n爆発しちゃいそうなくらい痛いからって！","zh":"真是的～，就说了脑袋疼得\n简直像要轰的一声爆炸开来一样啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4132c4f99a63e3579f4dc70c453cb34cb5221adbb5e04a7845665e04f6009c39","ja":"えっ！　あの……\nいわゆる、仮病ということでしょうか……？","zh":"咦！那个……\n也就是所谓的装病吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"ab6a6acf78ca33031d16afdd838f53ee708553b62bf89f2951349bbcaed3e242","ja":"そう！　って亜美！　お腹痛いのか頭痛いのか\n話を合わせないと……って、いいのかそれで！？","zh":"没错！……不对，亚美！你到底是肚子痛还是头痛，\n得把口径统一一下……等等，这样真的好吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"375c0ab3580de02b149484313ad2324f6897de75d57665fd3c93158b864bc11c","ja":"だってだって！　それならさすがに\n許してもらえるかな～って！　とにかく逃げ……。","zh":"可是可是！　那样的话\n大概怎么也能被原谅了吧～！　总之先逃……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"48cbffd51a01155bb4f38218a4267b3d2f11b020ca0284601a2c8817b010b1dd","ja":"ガチャ。","zh":"抽卡。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7ceca5c6bcb3ba3629d5d230228428d896fab0badc60bd30b11c63123eecb0fa","ja":"ああっ……！？","zh":"哎唷……！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1078.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"28e4ecc60745be3e53394adf9027649e5b4778670b7a951805fd5c722e35f493","ja":"ああ、亜美、昴さん……来てたんですね……。","zh":"啊，亚美、昴……你们来了啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
